resources.string:
When you plug in, wired or wireless, with Charging animation on. It doesn't play:
• if the back screen is dark and Light up back screen when plugged in is off;
• while the back is covered, such as lying face up on a table;
• while the main screen is on and turned sideways;
• within 10 seconds of the back screen last lighting up for something;
• while another app or Xiaomi Camera is on the back screen.
Plugging in again within 5 seconds doesn't play it again.
